Error [E0764]: `action` has no parameter labelled `value`
  --> named_arg_diagnostic_covers_unlabelled_function_values.jet:1:57
    |
  1 | fn apply(action: fn(Int) -> Int) -> Int { return action(value: 1) }
    |                                                         ^^^^^
 Why: A label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: `action` accepts ``
